openlivegamer4k (0.1.0~alpha4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Integrate measured HDMI audio clock setup and hardened cleanup/XRUN paths.
  * Support simultaneous stereo 48 kHz HDMI audio and video capture.
  * Present verified HDMI audio as a feature; document recovery and sync limits.
  * Include audio clock and shared-reset regression checks in package builds.

