openlivegamer4k (0.1.0~alpha3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release preparation: align version references in install/troubleshooting
    documentation and DKMS metadata, and qualify distribution target claims
    (tested on Mint 22.3; Ubuntu 24.04 intended but untested).
  * No driver or app code changes in this revision.
  * Source format switched to 3.0 (native): single-upstream project with no
    separate orig tarball; the Git export is the source archive.

