openlivegamer4k (0.1.0~alpha1-1) noble; urgency=low

  * Initial DKMS source package.
  * Payload: DKMS build inputs for module gc573_pure (driver source
    unchanged since 50bcea6; upstream
    https://github.com/royakem/OpenLiveGamer4K), package-specific
    install, troubleshooting and provenance documentation. The exact
    export commit of each artifact is recorded in its .buildinfo and in
    SOURCE-REVISION.md.
  * Maintainer scripts are generated by dh_dkms; they register and
    build the module for installed kernels. They never load or unload
    a module, touch a live device, write modprobe configuration, or
    enroll a MOK.
  * Capture activation is not automatic: the first module load must be
    issued with the documented bridge options. See README.Debian.

 -- Roy-Ake Martinsson <royakemartinsson@gmail.com>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:50:00 +0200
